@* تخطيط تطبيق المندوب: عربى RTL، شريط علوى بالاسم وحالة الاتصال والمزامنة، وحارس يوجّه لصفحة التفعيل أو الدخول. *@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@implements IDisposable
@inject AppState State
@inject NavigationManager Nav

<MudThemeProvider Theme="@_theme" />
<MudPopoverProvider />
<MudDialogProvider />
<MudSnackbarProvider />
<MudRTLProvider RightToLeft="true">
    <MudLayout>
        <MudAppBar Elevation="1" Dense="true" Color="Color.Primary">
            @if (_showBack)
            {
                <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ArrowForward" Color="Color.Inherit" aria-label="رجوع" OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo("/"))" />
            }
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="ra-grow" Style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">
                @(State.Ready && State.Session.LoggedIn ? State.Session.RepName : "مندوب المبيعات")
            </MudText>
            @if (State.Ready)
            {
                @if (State.Online)
                {
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Wifi" Title="متصل" aria-label="متصل" />
                }
                else
                {
                    <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Warning" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.WifiOff">بلا اتصال</MudChip>
                }
            }
        </MudAppBar>
        <MudMainContent>
            @if (!State.Ready)
            {
                <div class="ra-page"><MudProgressLinear Indeterminate="true" Color="Color.Primary" aria-label="جارٍ التحميل" /></div>
            }
            else if (_error != null)
            {
                <div class="ra-page"><MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error">@_error</MudAlert></div>
            }
            else
            {
                @Body
            }
        </MudMainContent>
    </MudLayout>
</MudRTLProvider>

@code {
    private readonly MudTheme _theme = new()
    {
        PaletteLight = new PaletteLight { Primary = "#1565C0", Secondary = "#00897B", AppbarBackground = "#1565C0" },
        Typography = new Typography { Default = new DefaultTypography { FontFamily = new[] { "Segoe UI", "Tahoma", "Noto Sans Arabic", "Arial", "sans-serif" } } },
    };
    private string? _error;
    private bool _showBack;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        try
        {
            await State.InitAsync();
            State.Changed += OnChanged;
            Nav.LocationChanged += OnLocation;
            Guard(Nav.Uri);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = "تعذر فتح قاعدة الجهاز: " + ex.Message; }
    }

    private void OnLocation(object? sender, LocationChangedEventArgs e) { Guard(e.Location); InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged); }

    /// <summary>بلا تفعيل → التفعيل؛ بلا دخول → الدخول؛ وإلا الصفحة المطلوبة.</summary>
    private void Guard(string uri)
    {
        string path = "/" + Nav.ToBaseRelativePath(uri).Split('?')[0];
        _showBack = path is not ("/" or "/activate" or "/login");
        if (!State.Session.IsActivated) { if (path != "/activate") Nav.NavigateTo("/activate"); return; }
        if (!State.Session.LoggedIn && path is not ("/login" or "/activate")) Nav.NavigateTo("/login");
    }

    private void OnChanged() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);

    public void Dispose()
    {
        State.Changed -= OnChanged;
        Nav.LocationChanged -= OnLocation;
    }
}
